│   13     ``sendmail(from_addr, to_addrs, msg)`` method performs a raw SMTP          │
│   14     transaction (HELO/MAIL FROM/RCPT TO/DATA) and returns a dict of            │
│   15     refused recipients. apprise has no equivalent "connection" object:         │
│   16     it exposes a stateless ``Apprise`` instance that is configured with        │
│   17     one or more service URLs (e.g. ``mailto://host:port/...``) and then        │
│   18     fires a notification via ``notify(title=..., body=...)``.                  │
