│   22     signature used by the caller. Internally, on each call it:                 │
│   23                                                                                │
│   24       * builds a ``mailto://host:port`` apprise URL, embedding the             │
│   25         sender and recipients as query parameters so apprise knows             │
│   26         who the mail is from/to,                                               │
│   27       * creates an ``apprise.Apprise()`` instance and registers that           │
│   28         URL,                                                                   │
│   29       * parses the raw header+body MIME-ish ``message`` string built by        │
│   30         the caller (headers separated from the body by a blank line)           │
│   31         to recover a ``subject`` and ``body``, and                             │
│   32       * calls ``apprise_obj.notify(title=subject, body=body)`` in place        │
│   33         of the raw SMTP DATA transaction.                                      │
