│    11     socket to a Modbus TCP server at (host, port). minimalmodbus has no       │
│    12     concept of a TCP client: minimalmodbus.Instrument is built around a       │
│    13     local serial port device path (e.g. "/dev/ttyUSB0") and a slave address,  │
│    14     and talks Modbus RTU/ASCII over that serial port. There is no faithful    │
│    15     way to turn a (host, port) pair into a minimalmodbus.Instrument without   │
│    16     an external serial-to-Modbus-TCP gateway, which this environment cannot   │
│    17     assume exists. Rather than silently returning something that looks        │
│    18     like a client but cannot actually talk to (host, port), this wrapper      │
│    19     raises a clear NotImplementedError describing the incompatibility.        │
│    20     """                                                                       │
