│    22         "minimalmodbus cannot construct a TCP client for "                    │
│    23         f"{host!r}:{port!r}; minimalmodbus.Instrument requires a local "      │
│    24         "serial port device path. A serial-to-Modbus gateway would be "       │
│    25         "needed to bridge this call, and none is configured."                 │
